{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-258",
  "title": "Slide Deck Outline",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Slide Deck Outline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Slide 1: The Problem**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Public access TV is in crisis. As cable viewership declines, so does the funding tied to it — threatening the survival of over 1,600 public access stations nationwide. Stations are forced to rely on clunky spreadsheets, aging broadcast systems, and manual workflows that were never built for the web era. Without modern tools, they’re unable to connect with digital audiences or streamline operations. The result: less engagement, shrinking resources, and an uncertain future."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Slide 2: The Solution — Custom Web Platform**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Docket.tv is a user-friendly, web-based platform designed for the needs of community broadcasters. It streamlines programming workflows with a modern TV Guide CMS, integrates with Cablecast APIs, supports live and VOD content, and empowers stations to connect with viewers across devices. It's the first platform purpose-built to bring the spirit of public access into the digital age."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Slide 3: Key Features**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**TV Guide CMS**: Manage schedules, shows, and channels in one place"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Cablecast Integration**: Real-time updates from legacy systems"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Viewer Tools**: Live chat, polls, comments, and show subscriptions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Accessibility**: Closed captions, ratings, audio descriptions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Analytics**: See what’s working with built-in insights"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Slide 4: Benefits for Speak MPLS**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Replace fragile spreadsheets with structured data and scheduling tools"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Make programming discoverable and engaging online"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Attract and support more creators through intuitive tools"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Automate repetitive workflows and reduce errors"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Build a scalable, sustainable digital foundation for the future"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Slide 5: Market Opportunity**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The video streaming market is projected to reach over $173B by 2028. Public access represents an underserved niche within that landscape — a network of hyperlocal broadcasters without modern tools. Docket.tv is positioned to become the backbone of digital infrastructure for this community, starting with hundreds of stations still relying on Cablecast, and expanding into new creator-driven formats."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Slide 6: Roadmap and Milestones**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Q1**: MVP deployed with Speak MPLS"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Q2**: Backend refactor for scale (Convex, Trigger.dev, Vercel Edge)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Q3**: Pilot expansion to 2–3 additional stations"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Q4**: Captioning tools, streaming integrations, and OTT-ready guide"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**2026**: Full market launch + seed raise"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Slide 7: Scope and Timeline**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Platform is live and actively used at Speak MPLS"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Next phase includes expanding core features, streamlining onboarding, and documenting success metrics"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Collaborative refinement with Rebecca + SPEAK will guide roadmap"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Estimated full rollout: 6–9 months from funding"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Slide 8: Partnership Proposal**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We want to formalize SPEAK MPLS as a key development partner. Your feedback, use cases, and real-world insight shape our product — and your station benefits from early access, tailored features, and long-term support. Together, we can show what’s possible when community media is treated like the powerful tool it is."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Slide 9: Next Steps**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Live demo of the current platform"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Gather feedback from key SPEAK stakeholders"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Identify short-term wins and high-priority integrations"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-49",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Draft agreement outlining partnership expectations and responsibilities"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-50",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Begin onboarding of additional producers + back catalog"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}